title: Employee2_Act1
---
Company Employee: I am watching all these Normies skiing down this mountain face.
Company Employee: They do not know what they are skiing on...
Company Employee: And I? I see the true art in this place.
Company Employee: There? Art!
Company Employee: And there! Also art!
-> Art?
    Company Employee: ART!
===

title: Employee2_Act2
---
Company Employee: The landscape is truly something to behold.
Company Employee: It saddens me to think of the plans The Company has for it, but it is something that must be done.
Company Employee: Do not mourn it, Simpleton. It is simply a new beginning of a man-made variety.
===

title: Employee2_Act3
---
Company Employee: So you wish to stop The Company dealings? 
Company Employee: I wish you luck. Not because I want you to win, but because I believe you will lose.
Company Employee: The Company is a beast and you are but a rabbit. And a rabbit stands no chance against the claws of a beast.
Company Employee: Rabbits holds no place with beasts.
Company Employee: ...
Company Employee: However, it must be said, but if you've seen a flash drive nearby, please discuss it with me.
Company Employee: It is mine. I did not realized newfangled objects could fall out of pockets like that.
===

title: Employee2_Act4
---
Company Employee: I was unable to truly portray the art of this place before I was forced to flee.
Company Employee: Like many artists before me, I will run from the places that do not apprieciate the arts.
Company Employee: I will have my moment elsewhere, then.
Company Employee: Until then, I bid you adieu.
===
